 <p>HT Calculator is a free, unofficial fan tool provided “as is”. Use it to plan your farm; don’t rely on it as the game’s ground truth. The game changes, the wiki lags, and we can be wrong - see the <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.</p>

